{
    "title": "SCE 1.3 Reactive Control - Malicious CodeBuild Project Remediation",
    "description": "Validates that a reactive control (EventBridge + Lambda) detects and automatically deletes a malicious CodeBuild project created by an attacker attempting credential exfiltration. The experiment creates the reactive infrastructure, simulates the attack by creating a malicious CodeBuild project with exfiltration commands in its buildspec, and verifies that the Lambda function successfully remediates the threat by deleting the project.",
